Memorial Weekend release.

22
01:18:34,285 --> 01:18:40,285
The supporting roles were cast between June and September 2012.

23
01:22:08,571 --> 01:22:14,571
Principal photography began in September 2012 in Los Angeles, California, before moving
to Nogales, Arizona, and Las Vegas, Nevada, concluding that November.

24
01:25:42,857 --> 01:25:48,857
The Hangover Part III premiered at the Westwood Village Theatre, in Los Angeles, on May
20, 2013, and was released theatrically on May 23, 2013, by Warner Bros.

25
01:29:17,142 --> 01:29:23,142
The film received negative reviews from critics, who deemed
it a disappointing conclusion to the trilogy.

26
01:32:51,428 --> 01:32:57,428
It also grossed $362 million worldwide against its $103 million
budget, making it the lowest-grossing film of the trilogy.

